/// The deterministic modelless reasoner. Produces structural strategies
/// and latent-scored actions. A Gemma2-extracted direction source (Phase 2)
/// must beat this on quality to justify its latency cost (the GOAT gate for
/// any learned-direction impl).
pub struct ModellessReasoner {
    /// Sigmoid temperature for the latent score. Higher = softer (more
    /// uniform selection);

