    /// Returns `true` if this `(viewer, target, epoch)` has NOT been
    /// submitted yet, AND records it as seen. Returns `false` (and does
    /// NOT re-record) if already seen.
    ///
    /// Call this BEFORE calling `report_aoi_violation` on the sink — it's
